# Security headers for every page. Cloudflare Pages reads this file.
# frame-ancestors lets SEED show this site in a frame: the published app (c2lanh4vgm.zite.so), its editor
# preview (zite-editor-c2lanh4vgm.zite.so) and the Zite editor around it (app.zite.com). If SEED moves to
# another address, add it here. Keep this rule, and don't add X-Frame-Options.
# The preview site's noindex header is set in Cloudflare, not here, so a merge can't carry it to the live site.
/*
  Content-Security-Policy: frame-ancestors 'self' https://c2lanh4vgm.zite.so https://zite-editor-c2lanh4vgm.zite.so https://app.zite.com
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=()
